   "title": "Read me",
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Character model sheet\nFront, 3/4 and rear for the owner's acceptance. The 3/4 and rear views take the front result as image 2, so they copy this man, not the older reference.\n\n**Differs from the `image_qwen_image_edit_2511` template:** `FluxKontextMultiReferenceLatentMethod` is refused `node_not_pinned`, so it's left out. It still gives a usable image at 40 steps, CFG 3, `euler`/`simple`, shift 3.1, `CFGNorm` 1.\n\nCrop the accepted views with `stage_parts.py` into `ref_head.png` and `ref_outfit.png` to use them as identity."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# Character model sheet\nFront, 3/4 and rear for the owner's acceptance. The 3/4 and rear views take the front result as image 2, so they copy this man, not the older reference.\n\n**Differs from the `image_qwen_image_edit_2511` template:** `FluxKontextMultiReferenceLatentMethod` is refused `node_not_pinned`, so it's left out. It still gives a usable image at 40 steps, CFG 3, `euler`/`simple`, shift 3.1, `CFGNorm` 1.\n\nCrop the accepted views with `stage_parts.py` into `ref_head.png` and `ref_outfit.png` to use them as identity."
   }
  }
 ],
 "version": 0.4
